<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13224" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόμισθ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>away from</i> (i. e.
				<i>without</i>) <i>pay, unpaid</i> or <i>underpaid,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.2.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄθλιοι ἀ. ξένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					4.46
				</span></i>
			; <i>defrauded of pay,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				138S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>paid off, discharged,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γίγνεται παρὰ Τιμοθέου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					23.154
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				5.2
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				11.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκή με θρὶξ ἀ. ποιεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					226
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
